data.regs#Regs:
The platform-provided MMIO accessor the register-level drivers (CRB, TIS) use to touch the TPM register block. off is a byte offset within the TPM register window.
type Regs interface { Read8(off uint32) uint8 Read32(off uint32) uint32 Write8(off uint32, v uint8) Write32(off uint32, v uint32) } Plus byte-stream helpers for the CRB command buffer / TIS FIFO:
func ReadBytes(r Regs, off uint32, p []byte) func WriteBytes(r Regs, off uint32, p []byte)
